    "components" : [ {
      "componentAttributes" : {
        "richTextValue" : "<p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"font-size: 48px; color: rgb(102, 163, 224);\">ACCESS DENIED</strong></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Your account does not have appropriate access rights to Intel Quote Request.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong style=\"color: rgb(102, 163, 224); font-size: 36px;\">Suggestions</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">Please follow <strong>one</strong> of the below steps depending on your current access rights:</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><ul><li style=\"text-align: center;\">If you <strong>do not have IQR access</strong>, please contact your Intel&nbsp;Account Manager or Intel&nbsp;Sales Rep to request access.</li><li style=\"text-align: center;\">If you&nbsp;<strong>have IQR access</strong>&nbsp;and was directed to this page by clicking on a bookmark link,&nbsp;<a href=\"https://quoterequest.intel.com/s/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">click this link</a>&nbsp;to try to login again. If the issue persists, please<a href=\"https://intelinside.intel.com/support?appgroup=IQR\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">&nbsp;click this link</a>&nbsp;to request help.</li><li class=\"ql-indent-1\" style=\"text-align: center;\">If you are looking&nbsp;to access the <strong>Altera portal</strong>, please be aware that the website has moved. Use <a href=\"http://distributorportal.altera.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"null\">distributorportal.altera.com</a>&nbsp;going forward and follow login instructions.</li></ul><p><br></p><p><br></p><p>&nbsp;</p>"
